abused it a lot, it decreases it.  Sample excercise/abuses:

Stregth, exercise:
	fighting, quaffing potion of healing, kicking, pushing boulders,
	carrying lots of stuff
Strength, abuse:
	becoming weak from hunger, kicking immovable things, hurting
	your leg

Dex, exersise:
	kicking a monster, picking a lock
Dex, abuse:
	being satiated, hurting your legs, getting caught in bear
	trap or pit

